Package: oofirewall
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: Sovereign declarative packet filtering and firewalld coordinator
 Declarative packet filtering coordinator backed by Linux nftables kernel sets.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 firewalld zone generation, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
